+# Mini Template
+
+A small, dependency-free TypeScript template renderer for Bun.
+
+```ts
+import { render } from "./src/engine";
+
+render("Hello, {{user.name}}!", { user: { name: "Ada" } });
+```
+
+Supported tags are escaped `{{path}}`, raw `{{{path}}}`, comments
+`{{! ... }}`, conditionals with optional `{{else}}`, and array iteration with
+optional `{{else}}`. Within `each`, use `{{this}}` for the item and `{{@index}}`
+for its index. Paths first resolve on the current item and then on root data.
